---
# Examples show sample values, ports and timeouts where they are used, as the documentation quotes
# them, let an exception end the program rather than wrap main() in handlers, and use the short
# brace forms the documentation teaches, such as tool_params({{"name", "string", "Who to greet"}}).
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: '-readability-magic-numbers,-bugprone-exception-escape,-modernize-use-designated-initializers'
...
